Template: @PACKAGE@/name
Type: string
Default: @DEFAULT_NAME@
Description: Name of a backend instance to create now:
 Its DEFAULT_PREFIX, which names /etc/bcc/<name>, /var/lib/bcc/<name>, the
 @BINARY@@<name> service and the backend in MSS. Leave it empty to create
 none; `sudo @BINARY@-provision <name>` creates one at any time.

Template: @PACKAGE@/executor
Type: select
Choices: @EXECUTORS@
Default: @DEFAULT_EXECUTOR@
Description: Executor of the instance:

Template: @PACKAGE@/port
Type: string
Default: @DEFAULT_PORT@
Description: Port the instance serves on:
 Each instance on this machine needs its own.

Template: @PACKAGE@/mss_url
Type: string
Default: http://localhost:8002
Description: URL of MSS:
